{
  "_comment": {
    "about": "2.678.0 P-H3 Image edit (PrunaAI/P-H3-Image-Comfy, Comfy-Org's image_p_h3_image_edit template, unfolded to the API format). The MiniMax H3 FL2VA transformer + the P-H3 LoRA (node 19, '(fixed)' = part of the model, never a style's LoRA slot - scripts/comfy_image.py), MiniMaxH3SigmaShift 1 / 1, the int8 text encoder + VAE (CLIPLoader type minimax), the w4a8 prompt upsampler (TextGenerateV2, greedy, thinking) turning the request into the full prompt, PH3ImageConditioning, 8 fixed sigmas, er_sde, BasicGuider (no CFG / negative). The prompt node 24 is a template: {prompt} = the request. <image1> (LoadImage 51) is the picture edited - scaled to 4 MP (multiples of 32), its size is the output's; <image2>..<image8> are references (unused slots bypassed - scripts/comfy_image.apply_images). LoRA slots 101..104 (bypassed when empty). Needs ComfyUI with the P-H3 nodes (0.44 / master).",
    "ph3": {
      "prompt_template": "node 24 value"
    }
  },
